gtimer (3.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Compile GSettings schema in the install prefix so an installed GUI
    finds gschemas.compiled and no longer aborts at startup (#10)
  * Document XDG_DATA_DIRS / GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR requirement for
    non-standard install prefixes

